WEBVTT

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:39.200
Seiryu!

00:01:51.730 --> 00:01:55.300
Ozma, with his sights set on
fulfilling the duty of the Saint Shields,

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:58.300
takes on Takao with
incredible strength.

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:04.690
Seiryu!!

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:12.320
Their clash of wills
ended in a draw.

00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:16.950
Having personally experienced the depth of
the bonds we share with our Sacred Beasts,

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:21.450
They decided to leave the
four Sacred Beasts in our care.

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:48.300
So they've given up on
sealing the four Sacred Beasts.

00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:52.090
Yes. They entrusted them
to Kinomiya and friends.

00:02:52.090 --> 00:02:54.900
Meaning that there's no
one left to get in our way.

00:02:58.930 --> 00:03:01.070
Doctor, this is Denny.

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:05.910
I believe we should give him Kraken,
another Sacred Beast from the tablet.

00:03:14.150 --> 00:03:16.050
Test it out.

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:17.350
Yes, ma'am.

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:21.260
Three! Two! One!

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:23.520
Go, Shoot!

00:03:24.770 --> 00:03:26.210
Kraken!

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:40.020
Whoa...

00:03:47.930 --> 00:03:50.540
What do you think
of Kraken's power?

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.240
Better than I
could have imagined.

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:56.770
That's right. You must take one of the
four Sacred Beasts, no matter what.

00:03:56.770 --> 00:03:57.880
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:08.030
We're counting
on you, Denny.

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:09.520
Allow me.

00:04:17.010 --> 00:04:18.950
Go, Dragoon!

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:21.100
Don't lose, Dranzer!

00:04:24.210 --> 00:04:26.290
They're both really into it.

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:32.600
Seiryu...

00:04:33.490 --> 00:04:36.790
I have to protect you.
For Ozma's team as well, now.

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:38.040
Yeah.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:40.610
Max, do you
want to battle?

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:41.800
Yeah!

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:45.890
Rei, try equipping
this to Driger.

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:47.730
What is it?

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:50.300
It's a Magne Weight Disk.

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:01.470
--Three! Two! One!

00:05:01.470 --> 00:05:04.000
--Go, Shoot!

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:17.540
Its attack power
has increased.

00:05:17.990 --> 00:05:19.120
Right!

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:22.500
Kyoujyu, that's no fair!
Why does Rei get one?

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:26.100
I'm thinking of new Weight
Disks for you and Kai right now.

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:27.900
Just wait a little longer, please.

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:31.020
Hey, guys!

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:33.590
Zeo!

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:40.160
What's the rush, Zeo?

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:44.990
Take a look at this!

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:47.130
I got it this morning!

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:51.330
It's an invitation to the
world championships!

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:57.710
The world championships are a
tournament that get held every year, right?

00:05:57.710 --> 00:06:03.220
Yup! It's a tournament to
determine the strongest Blader that year.

00:06:03.220 --> 00:06:07.470
And last year's winners happen to be right in front of you.

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:13.230
So what about the invitation?

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:21.220
I originally applied at the gym, but now that
I got this it feels like it's actually happening!

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:24.070
Man, the world championships!

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:25.630
Good for you!

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:26.660
Yeah!

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:29.440
Its been a year already, huh?

00:06:29.440 --> 00:06:31.600
Let's aim to win it again!

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:36.240
Good luck, guys!
I'll be rooting for you!

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:40.150
Hey now! Don't need to root for us
because you'll be entering too, right?

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:44.610
Yeah, but I'm
not aiming to win.

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:49.470
Just being able to enter the same
tournament as you is like a dream to me!

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:51.140
Oh, jeez.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:54.900
Only you would be
happy with just entering.

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:58.810
Yeah! If you're going to enter, you gotta keep winning!

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:02.610
Zeo, would you like
to practice with us?

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:03.540
Really?

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:05.140
Really!

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:07.630
Would you like to test this?

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:09.620
What is it?

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:17.240
It's the Ultimate Shooter, a device that can record
how many RPMs you can spin a Beyblade at.

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:19.220
It looks cool!

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:22.030
I wonder how
many you'll get?

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:25.790
I'm all set.

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:29.510
Go, Shoot!

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:38.060
29,568 RPMs.

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:39.610
How is that?

00:07:39.610 --> 00:07:43.310
The average is between
17,000 and 18,000.

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:46.420
Good work!

00:07:46.420 --> 00:07:47.530
I guess so.

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:50.040
So now it's my turn.

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:54.370
Go, Shoot!

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:00.400
50,000?!

00:08:00.890 --> 00:08:01.730
No way!

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:03.580
What, that's it?

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:07.120
That's the power of
a world-class Blader...

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:22.680
Found you.

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:36.260
Who's there?!

00:08:39.340 --> 00:08:43.620
I'm Denny. I came here to
steal your Sacred Beasts!

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:44.850
What?!

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:47.850
He must be from the
group that stole the tablet!

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:05.080
Who wants to be
my first victim?

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:06.400
Step up!

00:09:07.970 --> 00:09:13.990
Who's the one using Sacred Beasts from
the tablet and ordering you to steal ours?!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:17.910
It's time.

00:09:19.310 --> 00:09:24.710
You should be worrying about protecting
your own Sacred Beasts instead!

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:25.760
What?!

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:28.020
Who's first?

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:31.280
I won't let you take
our Sacred Beasts!

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:32.880
Let's fight!

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:34.350
Let me do it.

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:36.900
I'll defeat him.

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:38.000
Rei...

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:42.790
I almost feel
sorry for you.

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:46.830
Going out of your way to
volunteer to be my first victim!

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:50.390
Byakko and I will beat you!
Count on it!

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:58.860
Denny, the stadium is on the cliff.

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:00.980
Standby for the
rest of the plan.

00:10:01.190 --> 00:10:02.410
Got it?

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:03.950
Okay.

00:10:05.670 --> 00:10:06.660
Wait!

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:07.500
Rei!

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:18.850
Here I come!

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:19.930
Bring it on.

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:22.540
--Go, Shoot!

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:49.520
Denny! Summon Kraken!

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:51.430
Roger that.

00:10:51.430 --> 00:10:54.450
Rise, Kraken!!

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:23.570
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:30.530
Keep it up.
Go, Kraken!

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:42.320
Byakko!

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:54.670
There you are, Byakko.

00:11:54.670 --> 00:11:56.480
This battle is just
getting started.

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:04.110
Is that a Sacred Beast
from the stone tablet?

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:05.040
Yeah.

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:11.920
And those fox and spider Sacred Beasts that
attacked before are from the same tablet?

00:12:11.920 --> 00:12:14.630
We believe that
to be correct.

00:12:15.010 --> 00:12:17.370
Just what is
this stone tablet?

00:12:17.370 --> 00:12:21.330
It's something Max's mom has
been researching for a long time.

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:24.180
But in New York,
it was stolen.

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:28.200
We heard that the person who
stole it is a Japanese woman.

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:33.040
The one pulling the strings seems one of
Chairman Daitenji's former colleagues.

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:35.210
And is a scientist.

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:38.480
So this scientist is after
the four Sacred Beasts?

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:40.420
Exactly.

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:44.720
Why does a scientist
need the four Sacred Beasts?

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:46.900
How should we know?

00:12:46.900 --> 00:12:50.130
Go, Driger!
Beat that guy good!

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:56.210
Go, Byakko!

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.690
Kraken!

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:12.620
That's it, Kraken!
Drag him into the ocean!

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:14.430
Drag him down!

00:13:17.070 --> 00:13:18.410
Byakko!

00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:26.570
Keep it up, Kraken! Go!

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:35.170
Come on!

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:36.980
I will not lose!

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:38.520
Driger!

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:07.510
Yes! Go for it, Byakko!

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:20.210
I wonder why that
Blader is acting so confident.

00:14:20.470 --> 00:14:23.680
Denny, show them
what Kraken can do!

00:14:23.680 --> 00:14:24.630
Ma'am!

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:27.140
Kraken!

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:35.250
What the--?!

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:37.940
The tentacles that got
cut off have regrown!

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:50.590
Impossible!

00:14:55.250 --> 00:14:58.210
Now, Denny!
Use the other Bey!

00:14:58.210 --> 00:14:59.110
Yes, ma'am!

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:01.020
What?!

00:15:01.270 --> 00:15:03.520
Go, Shoot!

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:13.690
Kraken!

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:31.300
Two Sacred Beasts!

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:35.200
That's low!
This isn't a real battle!

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:47.700
Yes, Byakko is ours!

00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:49.940
Darn it! You won't
get away with this!

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:52.660
Takao!

00:15:58.450 --> 00:15:59.330
Doctor!

00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:01.010
Mind your own business.

00:16:01.010 --> 00:16:04.980
Block their path!
Don't let them approach Denny!

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:06.110
Yes!

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:32.650
Kai!

00:16:34.310 --> 00:16:37.430
Hiromi, are you okay?
Grab my hand!

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:43.780
Darn them!
That's messed up!

00:16:43.780 --> 00:16:46.000
I bet they're doing
it from that cruiser...

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:49.320
Hiromi!

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:54.500
Denny! Stop toying with
him and finish this!

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:56.820
Go, Kraken!

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:14.970
Rei!

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:15.900
Zeo!

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:18.870
Stop cheating!

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:25.650
That was too close!

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:27.850
Zeo!

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:29.700
Driger!

00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:32.320
Go, Zeronix!

00:17:37.010 --> 00:17:38.900
Beat it, fish bait!

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:44.200
I won't lose!

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:53.490
I'm still in this!

00:18:03.780 --> 00:18:06.550
I won't lose...

00:18:06.550 --> 00:18:08.100
I won't lose!

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:14.680
Damn brat...

00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:23.120
I won't lose...

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:25.120
Zeo...

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:26.910
Shut up!

00:18:48.340 --> 00:18:50.840
Go, Driger!

00:18:53.670 --> 00:18:55.820
I refuse to lose!

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:06.340
Shut him down, Byakko!

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:16.720
Keep it up, Driger!

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:26.960
Finish him off!
Driger!

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:36.680
No way...

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:51.800
But how...?

00:19:52.880 --> 00:19:54.660
Retrieving Denny.

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:55.620
Awright!

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:57.240
He won!

00:19:57.240 --> 00:19:59.490
Driger's new model
has proven its worth!

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:01.380
Its power has
been doubled!

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:02.880
Denny!

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:20.250
Zeo?

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:22.170
What's Zeo doing
with them?!

00:20:30.780 --> 00:20:32.640
You did it, Rei.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:36.260
No, it wasn't just me.

00:20:37.480 --> 00:20:41.480
I was able to win because
Zeo gave me courage.

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:45.890
Zeo is the real winner here.

00:20:46.270 --> 00:20:47.700
Thank you.

00:20:48.670 --> 00:20:50.150
Rei...

00:20:51.690 --> 00:20:55.230
I can fix your Bey later.

00:20:55.230 --> 00:21:00.430
Zeo, from here on out you're
the fifth Blader on the BBA team.

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:04.820
Is that cool with you guys?

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:11.520
I'm the fifth Blader
on the BBA team?

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:14.480
Oh, I could never...

00:21:14.850 --> 00:21:18.150
You're plenty qualified for it.

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:19.400
Rei...

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:22.040
All of you...
Thank you...

00:21:23.030 --> 00:21:26.190
We're gonna work
you to the bone, Zeo!

00:21:26.190 --> 00:21:27.800
So I hope you're ready!

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:29.760
I'm looking forward to it!

00:23:00.190 --> 00:23:03.430
The qualifying rounds of the world championships have finally begun!

00:23:03.430 --> 00:23:09.360
Zeo told us we would do our best
together, but he's parting ways with us?!

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:11.490
What could have
possibly happened?

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:14.450
But I have to train
for the tournament, too!

00:23:14.450 --> 00:23:17.490
Huh? I won't be battling?

00:23:17.490 --> 00:23:19.120
Mind your own business!

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:21.810
Let's get pumped and
work our hardest!
